>   dec_axppci_33_intr_map: slot 11, pin A: mapped to line 10
>   dec_axppci_33_intr_map: slot 12, pin A: pirq 1, reg = b0f0f0a
>   dec_axppci_33_intr_map: slot 12, pin A: mapped to line 15
>   pn0: <82c168/82c169 PNIC 10/100BaseTX> rev 0x21 int a irq 15 on pci0.12.0
> 
>   fatal kernel trap:
>   ...
