> works out to IRQ 11 (0b) for ncr0, IRQ 15 for de0 and de1 and/or pn0, and
> IRQ 10 for the mystery device in slot 11.
> 
> Earlier I hacked kern_intr.c and pci_compat.c to gracefully return errors
> all the way back to xx_attach()instead of falling through and dereferencing
